WEBVTT

00:09.110 --> 00:10.230
Hey.

00:12.450 --> 00:14.360
Are you a first-year?

00:14.360 --> 00:16.260
Who's asking?

00:17.000 --> 00:19.400
This isn't a parking lot,

00:19.770 --> 00:21.810
so maybe you should 
park that somewhere else.

00:23.390 --> 00:26.130
<i>Shouldn't she tell me not to 
ride a motorbike to school?</i>

00:26.760 --> 00:28.470
What an odd upperclassman.

00:31.330 --> 00:33.560
<i>Students weren't allowed to 
ride motorbikes to school.</i>

00:34.570 --> 00:36.100
<i>My buddy told me</i>

00:36.100 --> 00:39.170
<i>the lot behind the old club building 
was a great place to hide one.</i>

00:49.560 --> 00:51.840
We found something behind 
the old club building.

00:52.750 --> 00:56.160
If anyone knows what 
I'm talking about, come forward.

00:57.230 --> 01:00.950
<i>As luck would have it, I parked my bike
 somewhere else that day.</i>

01:01.460 --> 01:06.290
<i>By the end of class, the teachers
had apparently found the hiding spot.</i>

01:09.560 --> 01:11.570
Don't speak to me again.

01:12.500 --> 01:14.300
Yeah, got it.

01:16.530 --> 01:20.360
<i>I wasn't stupid or a troublemaker.</i>

01:20.950 --> 01:24.310
<i>The girls kind of liked me, 
so I tried my luck.</i>

01:25.210 --> 01:26.950
<i>That stings...</i>

01:27.640 --> 01:30.310
Didn't go as well as the last 
girl you talked to, did it?

01:30.780 --> 01:31.960
Got a minute?

01:31.960 --> 01:34.820
These boxes for the student 
council aren't heavy,

01:34.820 --> 01:37.400
but there are too many to carry at once.

01:39.650 --> 01:41.830
So you're on the student council?

01:41.830 --> 01:43.120
You could say that.

01:43.120 --> 01:45.540
But I mostly do grunt work.

01:45.540 --> 01:47.830
This is too much for one person to carry.

01:48.200 --> 01:49.830
How many trips have you made?

01:50.350 --> 01:53.010
Everyone has to do their part.

01:54.340 --> 01:55.960
Sengoku-kun!

01:57.710 --> 01:58.840
Koyanagi-san.

01:59.470 --> 02:02.960
It's about time. This is 
a time-sensitive matter.

02:02.960 --> 02:05.870
Any delay on your end delays everyone.

02:05.870 --> 02:07.090
Oh my...

02:09.950 --> 02:12.590
Looks like they're all here. Good work.

02:13.110 --> 02:16.610
I said good work. You can go now.

02:19.200 --> 02:20.610
Is there something else?

02:20.610 --> 02:23.210
You made a girl lug all those boxes here

02:23.210 --> 02:26.380
and all you can say is "good work,"
 Mr. Student Council President?

02:26.380 --> 02:28.410
How about a thank you?

02:30.440 --> 02:32.630
What class are you from?

02:33.490 --> 02:35.170
Class 1-9.

02:35.170 --> 02:36.380
I'm Hori Kyosuke.

02:38.410 --> 02:41.480
I'm Sengoku Takeru, class 3-1.

02:42.810 --> 02:46.040
Wear your uniform properly, first-year.

02:47.690 --> 02:49.100
And also...

02:49.510 --> 02:51.850
Thank you, Koyanagi-san.

02:58.950 --> 03:00.490
Sorry for butting in like that.

03:00.490 --> 03:01.790
What do you mean?

03:02.210 --> 03:05.870
I didn't think that it might make 
things awkward with the student council.

03:05.870 --> 03:08.620
If it got awkward, I'd just quit.

03:08.620 --> 03:11.170
<i>Huh, she's pretty easygoing.</i>

03:11.950 --> 03:16.190
Um, Koyanagi-san...

03:18.120 --> 03:19.920
Koyanagi Yuriko.

03:19.920 --> 03:21.970
I should have introduced myself sooner.

03:24.300 --> 03:25.410
<i>Yuriko...</i>

03:26.500 --> 03:28.980
<i>Koyanagi Yuriko...</i>

03:31.980 --> 03:36.000
I went to a dog café and saw 
a dog that looked just like you!

03:35.590 --> 03:37.940
<i>They say a person's name
captures who they are.</i>

03:36.000 --> 03:39.960
For real? Must've been one good-looking dog.

03:39.960 --> 03:41.040
<i>And I thought...</i>

03:42.690 --> 03:45.490
<i>she looked just like the lily in hers
when she smiled.</i>

03:48.680 --> 03:51.500
Koyanagi-san, what are you 
gonna do after graduation?

03:53.330 --> 03:55.560
I haven't really decided.

03:55.560 --> 03:56.590
What about you, Hori-kun?

03:56.590 --> 03:57.640
Me?

03:57.960 --> 04:00.010
I mean, I don't really know.

04:00.490 --> 04:02.010
That's how it goes.

04:04.210 --> 04:05.750
Say, Koyanagi-san...

04:06.590 --> 04:08.260
Once you graduate...

04:09.830 --> 04:12.270
<i>Even after you graduate...</i>

04:13.860 --> 04:16.110
Nah, forget I said that.

04:16.630 --> 04:17.760
Oh?

04:18.980 --> 04:22.620
<i>I feared crushing 
the flower I held in my hand.</i>

04:26.030 --> 04:28.280
What's Kyosuke to you?

04:30.160 --> 04:35.750
He's head over heels for a third-year, 
but you're not even pretty.

04:37.500 --> 04:38.500
Okay...

04:39.620 --> 04:41.980
Are you even listening?!

04:42.460 --> 04:46.470
Hurry up and graduate already
so you can get your ass away from him!

04:47.720 --> 04:49.220
Yuriko!

04:49.770 --> 04:50.530
Oh.

04:50.530 --> 04:51.550
Kyosuke!

04:51.550 --> 04:53.970
What are you doing to Yuriko?!

04:53.970 --> 04:57.120
Stay out of it! This is between me and her!

04:57.120 --> 04:57.860
You...

04:57.860 --> 04:59.110
Kyosuke, stop.

05:00.690 --> 05:03.940
A man should never
raise a hand against a woman.

05:08.920 --> 05:11.370
Oh, but that doesn't apply to me.

05:11.830 --> 05:13.370
I'm a woman, after all.

05:14.900 --> 05:18.500
<i>She was as gentle as a flower,
but this lily...</i>

05:19.940 --> 05:21.300
<i>had thorns.</i>

05:24.260 --> 05:27.760
That's when I knew she was the one.

05:27.760 --> 05:29.760
Sting

05:28.670 --> 05:29.760
I see.

05:29.760 --> 05:34.370
Listen, you should think of her slap 
as a sign of affection.

05:34.370 --> 05:35.890
I'll try.

05:36.200 --> 05:38.400
So, why'd she slap you?

05:38.840 --> 05:41.070
Huh? I don't remember...

05:41.870 --> 05:44.560
Yeah, that happens sometimes.

05:44.560 --> 05:49.140
Well, Kyoko can be dangerous 
once she gets angry, so be careful.

05:49.140 --> 05:50.350
I see...

05:51.210 --> 05:52.220
Kyosuke-san!

05:52.220 --> 05:54.870
Huh? What is it, Miyamura-kun?

05:54.870 --> 05:58.660
It suddenly started hurting a lot more!

05:57.370 --> 06:01.380
<b>Throb...</b>

05:58.660 --> 05:59.970
Really?!

05:59.970 --> 06:01.380
So that happens to you, too?!

06:01.380 --> 06:04.140
Ow... Ow... Ow, ow, ow!

06:04.800 --> 06:08.930
What?! It hurts... Why?! Ouch!

06:05.120 --> 06:07.090
Suck it up!

06:07.090 --> 06:08.930
Don't give in, Miyamura-kun!

07:39.100 --> 07:42.480
<b>The Hori House</b>

07:42.480 --> 07:45.770
Kyosuke, I need to borrow a shirt.

07:45.770 --> 07:46.980
A t-shirt will do.

07:46.980 --> 07:49.610
Why? Are you gonna use it as a rag?

07:49.610 --> 07:55.370
No. All the shirts I use after 
a bath are in the laundry, so...

07:55.370 --> 07:57.590
I don't have any cute ones.

07:57.590 --> 08:00.120
If you handed me a cute one,
 I wouldn't take it.

08:00.530 --> 08:04.750
As long as you don't mind one 
that's way too big for you...

08:04.750 --> 08:06.240
Not like I have a choice.

08:06.590 --> 08:08.230
Big Sis, look!

08:08.230 --> 08:10.520
Mama bought this for me!

08:10.520 --> 08:12.090
N-Nice.

08:12.090 --> 08:15.480
It floats, really! It floats in water!

08:18.010 --> 08:18.970
<b>Lift</b>

08:18.970 --> 08:20.860
Vengeful spirit!

08:18.970 --> 08:24.230
<b>Squeeze</b>

08:20.860 --> 08:21.840
Vengeful spirit?!

08:21.840 --> 08:24.230
Did you mean to say "vicious beast"?

08:24.580 --> 08:26.090
What's this, Kyoko?

08:26.090 --> 08:28.590
Have you developed...

08:29.190 --> 08:30.610
a brother composite?!

08:30.610 --> 08:33.010
"Composite"? Do you mean a brother <i>complex</i>?

08:33.010 --> 08:36.490
And no! I was just wondering
if Sota's clothes would fit me!

08:36.880 --> 08:38.810
Probably too small.

08:38.810 --> 08:41.750
You ate a ton of mochi 
over New Year's, remember?

08:41.750 --> 08:43.680
Wh-What?!

08:43.680 --> 08:45.750
Are you saying I'm fat?!

08:45.750 --> 08:48.350
No, I wouldn't go that far—

08:48.350 --> 08:49.820
Same difference, idiot!

08:49.820 --> 08:51.000
Oh my.

08:51.460 --> 08:54.050
It'll fit, and I'll prove it!

08:54.050 --> 08:56.410
Sota, get me a t-shirt!

08:56.410 --> 08:59.010
Huh? I don't want to.

08:59.010 --> 09:01.540
Fine, then I'll go get it!

09:02.020 --> 09:04.430
<b>Rrring</b>

09:02.510 --> 09:04.430
Can I call Miyamura-kun?

09:04.430 --> 09:05.940
Do whatever you want!

09:07.210 --> 09:09.650
It's an ordinary day,
but things are still so fun.

09:10.070 --> 09:12.510
Hey, Miyamura-kun, are you free?

09:12.510 --> 09:14.210
We're doing HFW here.

09:14.210 --> 09:15.210
HFW.

09:15.210 --> 09:16.150
HFW?

09:16.680 --> 09:19.690
What, Miyamura-kun?
You've never heard of HFW?

09:19.690 --> 09:21.970
Well, today's actually the first ever.

09:21.970 --> 09:24.410
Ah, swapping "Hori" for "Paris" in PFW.

09:25.540 --> 09:27.500
Well?! See?!

09:27.500 --> 09:29.540
It fits just fine!

09:30.070 --> 09:31.910
A hoodie is cheating, don't you think?

09:31.910 --> 09:34.160
They're meant to be big.

09:35.570 --> 09:40.180
What's really surprising is how tight 
clothes make your chest look bigger.

09:40.870 --> 09:42.540
Shut up! You're the worst!

09:42.850 --> 09:44.180
<i>But...</i>

09:44.180 --> 09:48.760
<i>High schoolers normally can't wear 
elementary schooler's clothes.</i>

09:48.190 --> 09:53.940
<b>They leave things unsaid</b>

09:52.480 --> 09:53.940
Can you get that, Kyosuke?

09:53.940 --> 09:56.190
He won't be able to argue with <i>this</i>!

09:56.950 --> 09:59.570
See? It fits just fine!

09:59.570 --> 10:01.880
Oh, it's Sota's shirt.

10:01.740 --> 10:02.830
<b><i>SNAP</i></b>

10:02.830 --> 10:04.830
<b>Shock</b>

10:04.830 --> 10:07.410
Wh-Wh-What's he doing here?

10:07.410 --> 10:09.040
You told me to do whatever I wanted.

10:09.040 --> 10:10.060
No, I didn't!

10:10.060 --> 10:11.840
Ah, I'm so embarrassed!

10:11.840 --> 10:13.880
Your belly button's showing.
That must be cold.

10:12.130 --> 10:13.710
<b>Comment</b>

10:13.880 --> 10:15.550
<b>Comment</b>

10:13.880 --> 10:16.010
Kyoko, he says your flap is hanging out.

10:16.010 --> 10:18.220
<b>Comment</b>

10:16.010 --> 10:18.220
Big Sis, what part of the cow is flap meat?

10:18.220 --> 10:19.590
Shut up!

10:19.970 --> 10:22.550
The Hori house is always so much fun.

10:22.550 --> 10:24.940
I'm not having any fun.

10:25.370 --> 10:28.100
I ate too much mochi and gained weight.

10:28.570 --> 10:31.760
<i>Girls really worry about their weight, huh?</i>

10:32.330 --> 10:34.360
So why were you having a fashion show?

10:35.270 --> 10:36.820
Good question.

10:36.820 --> 10:39.610
I was going to borrow 
a shirt from Kyosuke...

10:39.940 --> 10:42.480
Kyoko turned into a vicious beast.

10:43.370 --> 10:46.340
Or, wait, maybe it was a vengeful spirit.

10:43.660 --> 10:52.630
<b>Comment</b>

10:45.910 --> 10:52.630
<b>Comment</b>

10:46.340 --> 10:48.160
But she was just trying to borrow a shirt.

10:48.160 --> 10:51.210
Big Sis, is our house haunted?!

10:48.160 --> 10:52.630
<b>Comment</b>

10:51.210 --> 10:52.630
Shut up!

10:52.630 --> 10:57.150
You're the loudest of all
when you shout like that, Kyoko.

10:57.150 --> 10:59.370
You're the one making stupid comments!

10:57.760 --> 11:00.620
Miyamura-kun, you're 
staying for dinner, right?

10:59.370 --> 11:01.210
{bg}Oh, so it's my fault?

11:01.210 --> 11:03.010
Oh, yes, thank you.

11:01.500 --> 11:05.110
{bg}Why do you always try to blame me?

11:05.110 --> 11:08.390
You'll end up a delinquent.

11:06.430 --> 11:08.390
Let's eat before it gets cold.

11:08.390 --> 11:09.520
Okay!

11:09.520 --> 11:12.270
You saying that at your age
when you're the root of all evil!

11:12.270 --> 11:14.040
Your life needs a do-over!

11:14.040 --> 11:16.940
Even if I do it over, I'll still be your father!

11:16.940 --> 11:19.340
I'm never giving that up! You can rest easy!

11:19.340 --> 11:20.530
No, I can't!

11:20.530 --> 11:23.080
That's what freaks me out!

11:21.700 --> 11:24.330
The Hori house really is fun.

11:33.130 --> 11:34.540
Sota!

11:35.630 --> 11:37.300
You made a mess again!

11:37.300 --> 11:40.030
I was just about to clean it up.

11:40.030 --> 11:41.050
I've heard that before!

11:41.050 --> 11:42.560
It's true!

11:42.560 --> 11:44.260
You always leave your messes behind.

11:44.260 --> 11:45.800
No, I don't!

11:45.800 --> 11:48.310
<b>Grit</b>

11:46.200 --> 11:48.310
Hey, hey, what are you so angry about?

11:48.760 --> 11:51.330
Sota leaves his stuff all over the place.

11:51.330 --> 11:55.690
No! I was about to clean up, 
but then she started yelling!

11:55.690 --> 11:56.920
You heard him.

11:56.920 --> 12:00.690
Oh, so you're on his side, eh?

12:00.690 --> 12:04.010
I-I made some tea. Maybe we could...

12:04.450 --> 12:05.320
Listen!

12:05.320 --> 12:05.930
Listen!

12:05.930 --> 12:07.250
Listen to this!

12:07.620 --> 12:09.610
Um, okay... I'll hear you out.

12:09.610 --> 12:11.330
Let's just sit down first.

12:15.330 --> 12:17.080
Um...

12:17.080 --> 12:20.820
Sota's been doing a good job 
of cleaning up lately.

12:22.460 --> 12:25.790
Maybe he just left his stuff out today.

12:25.790 --> 12:28.210
You get too angry!

12:28.210 --> 12:29.600
Way too angry!

12:29.970 --> 12:32.600
<b>Hmph...</b>

12:31.450 --> 12:32.600
Poke, poke.

12:31.810 --> 12:32.600
<b>Poke</b>

12:32.100 --> 12:32.600
<b>Poke</b>

12:32.980 --> 12:36.260
Kyoko, I'm on your side.

12:37.630 --> 12:39.020
Kyosuke...

12:39.830 --> 12:44.630
I've always wondered why you 
jump the gun when you get angry.

12:44.630 --> 12:48.000
It's more than just being 
short-tempered. Are you okay?

12:48.350 --> 12:49.870
Kyosuke-san!

12:50.870 --> 12:52.390
Now she's run off!

12:52.390 --> 12:54.840
I asked you not to upset her!

12:54.840 --> 12:57.250
I didn't mean it!

12:58.330 --> 13:00.250
Big Sis!

13:00.250 --> 13:03.490
Kyoko, remember that I'm on your side!

13:03.490 --> 13:05.260
Come on out!

13:05.300 --> 13:08.010
<b>Open...</b>

13:06.450 --> 13:08.010
Oh, there she is.

13:08.820 --> 13:10.510
Kyoko—

13:09.230 --> 13:10.510
Don't touch me.

13:11.050 --> 13:12.520
Big Sis—

13:11.470 --> 13:12.520
Don't touch me.

13:13.400 --> 13:14.890
Hori-san—

13:13.690 --> 13:14.890
Don't touch me.

13:15.320 --> 13:17.640
What's this about not touching her?

13:17.640 --> 13:21.880
Dunno. Maybe it's her way 
of letting us know that she's angry.

13:19.400 --> 13:22.400
<b><i>SEETHE...</i></b>

13:22.400 --> 13:24.170
Whoa, he's cleaning up!

13:22.400 --> 13:25.900
<b>Shuffle Shuffle</b>

13:24.170 --> 13:26.400
Sota's cleaning up, Hori-san!

13:31.410 --> 13:34.040
Sota can come through when—

13:32.840 --> 13:34.040
Don't touch me.

13:33.790 --> 13:34.660
<b><i>Slap!!</i></b>

13:35.090 --> 13:36.600
Hori-san!

13:35.500 --> 13:36.600
Don't touch me.

13:36.710 --> 13:37.670
<b><i>Slap!!</i></b>

13:38.330 --> 13:41.250
What's going on, Miyamura-kun?!

13:41.250 --> 13:42.370
It looks bleak.

13:42.370 --> 13:45.300
We need to calm her down little by little.

13:48.210 --> 13:50.360
Hori-san, want some pudding?

13:50.360 --> 13:51.300
I've given it up.

13:51.300 --> 13:53.260
Kyoko-chan, should I rub your shoulders?

13:53.260 --> 13:54.430
Don't touch me.

13:54.430 --> 13:55.220
Kyoko—

13:55.220 --> 13:56.480
Don't touch me.

13:56.480 --> 13:57.980
Really?

14:04.480 --> 14:06.810
We're in outer space!

14:09.490 --> 14:10.950
What are you talking about?

14:10.950 --> 14:12.050
This is our house.

14:12.540 --> 14:14.240
H-Hori-san...

14:14.490 --> 14:19.550
This is outer space and we're in a spaceship!

14:15.910 --> 14:17.370
<b>SHOVE
SHOVE</b>

14:18.420 --> 14:19.880
<b>SHOVE
SHOVE</b>

14:19.550 --> 14:22.480
I'm trying to study, okay?

14:19.550 --> 14:22.480
If you go outside, you'll die!

14:21.170 --> 14:22.630
<b>SHOVE
SHOVE</b>

14:22.880 --> 14:24.540
Space sounds like fun!

14:24.540 --> 14:26.110
I wouldn't mind going!

14:26.110 --> 14:27.250
Don't close your notebooks!

14:27.250 --> 14:28.900
Don't put away your textbooks!

14:30.770 --> 14:33.890
If you leave this area, 
you'll die 'cause there's no air.

14:33.890 --> 14:38.290
Where did you even find this old carpet?

14:38.290 --> 14:40.980
We're gonna build a villa on the moon!

14:40.980 --> 14:42.150
Sounds good!

14:45.280 --> 14:46.150
<b>Push</b>

14:51.010 --> 14:54.360
My big sister killed me!

14:54.980 --> 14:56.910
You will now address me as captain.

14:57.400 --> 14:59.660
<i>A heartless, unfeeling captain.</i>

15:00.040 --> 15:03.180
We're circling Mars!

15:04.930 --> 15:09.910
Now I'm friends with this Martian!

15:11.550 --> 15:14.300
Aw, man...

15:14.300 --> 15:16.410
<i>She's just taken over the ship,</i>

15:16.410 --> 15:18.710
<i>and she's already recruiting
 more crew members.</i>

15:18.710 --> 15:21.060
<i>Just who is Hori-san?</i>

15:21.060 --> 15:22.840
Bis Sis!

15:23.560 --> 15:24.520
Come on!

15:25.760 --> 15:28.370
Hori-san, um...

15:28.370 --> 15:31.380
Can Sota come back on the ship?

15:33.070 --> 15:38.020
Then he'd grow into a weak man who thinks
he can just get whatever he wants.

15:38.450 --> 15:43.080
He was the one who decided that 
whoever leaves this area would die.

15:43.540 --> 15:46.450
All I did was push him.

15:45.090 --> 15:48.800
<b>Squeeze</b>

15:47.800 --> 15:50.300
<b>Push him
(to certain death)</b>

15:51.800 --> 15:54.850
What's that? A new vehicle?

15:54.850 --> 15:59.310
Yeah. I managed to board an escape pod.

15:59.840 --> 16:04.490
The sorrow of betrayal will 
fuel my quest for revenge.

16:04.490 --> 16:05.940
Do you even know what that means?

16:05.940 --> 16:08.010
You can do it, Sota!

16:06.230 --> 16:07.070
<b>Scoot</b>

16:07.360 --> 16:08.190
<b>Scoot</b>

16:08.010 --> 16:08.980
Yeah!

16:08.480 --> 16:09.400
<b>Scoot</b>

16:09.970 --> 16:12.640
There's a spy in our midst!

16:12.640 --> 16:14.820
I'm cheering for him since 
he's part of our crew!

16:15.570 --> 16:21.130
I'll have to be a captain 
who doesn't trust a single soul.

16:21.130 --> 16:24.580
Man... this is a lot.

16:26.430 --> 16:28.290
Take this!

16:28.960 --> 16:31.920
Yes, I beat her!

16:32.390 --> 16:33.970
I won, Big Bro—

16:39.250 --> 16:41.210
Sota, run for it!

16:40.020 --> 16:44.940
<b><i>RUMBLE</i></b>

16:41.210 --> 16:43.900
The captain is immortal!

16:49.440 --> 16:51.480
<b>Glance...</b>

16:52.320 --> 16:54.200
Sota, are you doing kanji?

16:54.200 --> 16:55.240
Yeah.

16:56.110 --> 17:00.220
Aw, man, I wish that was my homework.

17:00.220 --> 17:01.750
You're a third-year high schooler.

17:02.460 --> 17:08.000
"Make a compound word 
using the word 'forest.'"

17:08.000 --> 17:09.240
Forestland.

17:08.000 --> 17:10.250
<b>Quick answer</b>

17:10.250 --> 17:14.050
Hori-san, he needs to think about it himself.

17:14.050 --> 17:15.220
Oh!

17:15.480 --> 17:17.010
I'm home!

17:17.260 --> 17:19.570
Oh, Sota, you're doing homework?

17:19.570 --> 17:22.010
Ask me for whatever you need.

17:22.010 --> 17:23.950
You smell like cigarettes!

17:23.950 --> 17:25.520
Not what I was expecting.

17:25.520 --> 17:26.920
Kyosuke stinks.

17:26.920 --> 17:28.030
Because of the cigarettes!

17:28.030 --> 17:29.930
Don't make it sound like <i>I</i> stink.

17:29.930 --> 17:30.880
Stinky.

17:31.510 --> 17:32.780
<i>Kicking a man while he's down...</i>

17:32.780 --> 17:37.280
<b>Kanji Drills
Hori Sota</b>

17:34.530 --> 17:37.280
The "So" in your name is hard to write, huh?

17:37.280 --> 17:41.280
Still, it's really impressive that 
you're learning kanji in first grade.

17:42.120 --> 17:43.410
He's supposed to, isn't he?

17:43.410 --> 17:47.920
I couldn't write the kanji
for my given name either.

17:48.120 --> 17:52.340
I can't do it!

17:48.120 --> 17:52.340
Miyamura Iz

17:49.250 --> 17:52.340
Izmi

17:50.500 --> 17:52.340
Izui

18:14.430 --> 18:17.810
You're such a good helper, Sota.

18:17.810 --> 18:19.340
I hope you'll help me again.

18:19.340 --> 18:20.200
Sure!

18:39.330 --> 18:42.590
Sota, let's finish your homework—

18:43.100 --> 18:44.850
What are you doing?!

18:43.140 --> 18:44.600
<b>Clack</b>

18:45.940 --> 18:48.520
I told you to let me do those!

18:48.520 --> 18:50.430
Um, but...

18:50.430 --> 18:51.980
No buts!

18:55.980 --> 18:58.720
You could cut yourself on the knives.

19:03.950 --> 19:05.990
You're a jerk!

19:05.990 --> 19:07.260
What?

19:05.990 --> 19:08.000
<b><i>WAAAH</i></b>

19:06.290 --> 19:08.000
<b>Shock</b>

19:08.000 --> 19:11.360
I told you it's dangerous 
to do it on your own!

19:12.050 --> 19:14.610
You always get angry right away!

19:14.610 --> 19:16.620
Why don't you understand?!

19:18.950 --> 19:20.120
What's wrong?

19:20.120 --> 19:21.260
Like I said!

19:21.260 --> 19:23.790
Sota was trying to...

19:23.790 --> 19:24.620
Yeah.

19:24.620 --> 19:26.260
And it's dangerous!

19:26.260 --> 19:27.410
Yeah.

19:28.270 --> 19:33.080
Well, Kyoko can be dangerous 
once she gets angry, so be careful.

19:33.870 --> 19:37.030
Hori-san, there's a better way to say that.

19:38.280 --> 19:42.050
Sota was just trying to help.

19:42.050 --> 19:43.780
He's in first grade now.

19:44.590 --> 19:47.000
And you've washed them before, right?

19:47.000 --> 19:48.000
Yeah.

19:49.670 --> 19:53.340
But you understand what 
your sister is saying too, don't you?

19:53.340 --> 19:54.300
Yeah.

19:55.460 --> 19:57.810
He gets it, Hori-san—

19:57.810 --> 19:59.050
Huh?!

19:59.050 --> 20:00.840
Wh-What's wrong?!

20:00.840 --> 20:02.800
I... I just...

20:03.460 --> 20:05.070
I should have...

20:05.730 --> 20:08.410
Um, but what you said wasn't wrong.

20:08.410 --> 20:09.590
It's okay.

20:10.080 --> 20:12.060
But you...

20:12.730 --> 20:15.510
Did you think I was angry with you?

20:15.510 --> 20:17.910
I'm not. Really, I'm not.

20:17.910 --> 20:19.550
Sota was just...

20:19.550 --> 20:22.070
And you weren't wrong!

20:24.450 --> 20:26.200
<b>Big Sis is upset because of me!</b>

20:26.200 --> 20:28.550
<i>What's going on?!</i>

20:26.240 --> 20:27.450
<b>Fuss</b>

20:26.990 --> 20:28.200
<b>Fuss</b>

20:28.240 --> 20:29.450
<b>Fuss</b>

20:28.550 --> 20:29.400
<i>What is this?</i>

20:28.990 --> 20:30.250
<b>Fuss</b>

20:29.400 --> 20:30.700
<i>I don't know what to do!</i>

20:30.250 --> 20:30.700
<b>Fuss</b>

20:33.040 --> 20:35.210
Oh, you guys look like you're having fun.

20:35.210 --> 20:36.560
Can you step in?

20:36.560 --> 20:38.170
What?

20:38.170 --> 20:40.220
Sounds like a pain, so I'll pass.

20:44.390 --> 20:46.220
I'm sorry, Hori-san.

20:47.220 --> 20:51.100
Sota's still just a kid, 
and I'm an only child.

20:51.100 --> 20:54.230
I don't really know much about discipline.

20:55.170 --> 20:59.130
I know you're trying 
to do what's best for him.

21:05.500 --> 21:07.810
<i>Maybe I was too harsh.</i>

21:10.810 --> 21:15.500
I don't like it when you're not on my side.

21:18.750 --> 21:21.780
Huh? But I <i>am</i> on your side.

21:24.590 --> 21:26.510
Then... it's fine.

21:27.410 --> 21:32.520
But when I think you're doing 
something wrong, I'll get angry.

21:32.520 --> 21:35.520
<b>Smirk...</b>

21:34.090 --> 21:35.520
<i>Is that a smile?</i>

21:35.520 --> 21:37.810
So, specifically, when you get angry...

21:37.810 --> 21:40.470
are you gonna yell "stop it!" and smack me?

21:40.470 --> 21:42.530
I'm not gonna smack you!

21:42.530 --> 21:46.030
<b>Hori is back to normal</b>

23:12.490 --> 23:15.990
Next time
page.13 Graduation

23:15.990 --> 23:20.000
About my family

23:15.990 --> 23:20.000
<b>SMILE</b>

23:16.490 --> 23:20.000
My teacher liked what I wrote at school!

23:20.370 --> 23:24.250
Hey, Mom, Sota wrote something 
at school and the teacher liked it.

23:24.250 --> 23:25.750
<b>Oh my</b>

23:24.250 --> 23:25.750
Oh my!

23:25.750 --> 23:28.330
Hey, you wrote about your family.

23:28.330 --> 23:30.310
That's great! Let me see it.

23:30.310 --> 23:31.130
Sure!

23:32.220 --> 23:34.010
It's called "My Big Brother."

23:34.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Stare</b>

23:35.990 --> 23:38.380
I'm so sorry...
